1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
THE FORMER GROOM: I cannot marry you, Juliana.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,500
THE FORMER GROOM: You are far too plain...

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,500
THE FORMER GROOM: ...far too silent...

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,000
THE FORMER GROOM: ...and completely beneath the future I deserve.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,500
LADY JULIANA: Gerald... Look at me.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,600
LADY JULIANA: You gave me your word before both our families.

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,700
THE FORMER GROOM: Promises change when a better choice appears.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,400
LADY JULIANA: A better choice? Is that what she is?

9
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,500
THE FORMER GROOM: She is what I should have chosen from the beginning.

10
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,400
LADY JULIANA: Father...

11
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,100
LADY JULIANA: Surely you will not let him humiliate me like this?

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:42,300
BLOND NOBLEMAN: Gerald has made his choice. Accept it, Juliana.

13
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,700
BLOND NOBLEMAN: Do not disgrace us further.
